          <output>Done. Updated `blocks/org/blockml/bml/workspace/playground/TravelPostcard.bml` with a freshly invented Lisbon postcard:

- **title**: &quot;Greetings from the Alfama&quot;
- **destination**: Lisbon
- **opening**: one vivid sentence (ginjinha on an Alfama step, church bells, drying laundry)
- **body**: three short paragraphs (tram 28 to Miradouro de Santa Luzia; grilled sardines and vinho verde; Belém tarts and the tower)
- **language**: English
- **date**: `2026-09-05T21:02:30` (operation start = now)

