              <instructions>Create or update the block ${ #this.parameters.targetBlock }
as a short travel postcard in ${ #this.parameters.language }
about ${ #this.parameters.destination }.
For each execution invent a new postcard.
The block must have these properties:
- title (type:Text) — a short postcard title
- destination (type:Text) — ${ #this.parameters.destination }
- opening (type:Text) — one vivid opening sentence
- body (type:Text) — three short postcard paragraphs
- language (type:Text) — ${ #this.parameters.language }
- date (type:DateTime) — now
Write only under the playground package. Do not edit
ModelTransformation metadata or files under _meta/transform/.</instructions>
            </workflow:InstructionTask>
          </task>
